t them as well. https://t.co/2tOSw2qUm1 https://t.co/PhwGpWtTI2", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2118012530215854477"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:26:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118002043247874107"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/QvLYeL5l9K", "end": 264, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2118002043247874107/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117998263416561664", "start": 241, "url": "https://t.co/QvLYeL5l9K"}]}, "id": "2118002043247874107", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 12996, "like_count": 48, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 7}, "text": "New trade data out this morning. Trade balance for the year as a whole similar to previous years but under the surface massive movements--a huge reduction in trade deficit ex data center stuff &amp; increase in deficit in data center stuff. https://t.co/QvLYeL5l9K", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2118002043247874107"}, {"author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:17:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117999628939325756"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 47, "id": "2239701", "start": 35, "username": "AlexanderNL"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/n2ZTpSK6GN", "end": 196, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117999628939325756/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117999111387467776", "start": 173, "url": "https://t.co/n2ZTpSK6GN"}]}, "id": "2117999628939325756", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 9773, "like_count": 43, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "Thanks to all my Dutch readers and @AlexanderNL, my incredible publisher there, for making the Dutch translation of Co-Existence the #1 non-fiction book in the Netherlands! https://t.co/n2ZTpSK6GN", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2117999628939325756"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:56:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117994421396377677"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/2p0YtRZVGB", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2117994421396377677/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117993626630246400", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/2p0YtRZVGB"}]}, "id": "2117994421396377677", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 176, "impression_count": 160474, "like_count": 505, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 109}, "text": "Stock markets up after election results. But what is most interesting is the composition. Health and solar up, data centers and Musk-related down. Crypto up may be the one I wouldn't have expected.\n\nAnd note, markets presumably had already been pricing in large Democratic gains. https://t.co/2p0YtRZVGB", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2117994421396377677"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:51:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117993020188668077"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/lav94QT0En", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117993020188668077/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117992954166177792", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/lav94QT0En"}]}, "id": "2117993020188668077", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 41, "impression_count": 63314, "like_count": 738, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 71, "retweet_count": 80}, "text": "A double whammy this morning for hardline Republicans in finance that most did not anticipate:\nDemocrats secured majorities in both houses of Congress, AND stocks opened solidly higher while oil prices and bond yields fell.\nIt's important for Republicans to not repeat the mistake https://t.co/lav94QT0En", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117993020188668077"}, {"author_id": "15072071", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:31:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117988028329140268"], "id": "2117988028329140268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 3213, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Why can two borrowers who look much alike be offered very different rates when applying for a credit card? The authors examine how the rate offered changes when the lender’s funding cost falls.", "url": "https://x.com/NewYorkFed/status/2117988028329140268"}, {"author_id": "25098482", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:00:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117980355739480237"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Southeast Asia must adapt to geopolitical shocks by strengthening ASEAN, balancing openness, and building new partnerships", "display_url": "imf.org/en/publication…", "end": 198, "expanded_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/publications/fandd/issues/2026/09/thriving-in-a-fragmented-world-ben-bland", "images": [{"height": 1077, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117980408549986305/5kR8UCBv?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 2656}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117980408549986305/5kR8UCBv?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 175, "status": 200, "title": "Thriving in a Fragmented World", "unwound_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/publications/fandd/issues/2026/09/thriving-in-a-fragmented-world-ben-bland", "url": "https://t.co/WBWCYrkZKH"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/d602znCtAh", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2117980355739480237/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117980236612874240", "start": 199, "url": "https://t.co/d602znCtAh"}]}, "id": "2117980355739480237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 11122, "like_count": 34, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "As protectionism rises and geopolitical tensions deepen, Southeast Asia has an opportunity to strengthen ASEAN and chart its own course, Ben Bland writes in F&amp;D magazine. https://t.co/WBWCYrkZKH https://t.co/d602znCtAh", "url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2117980355739480237"}, {"author_id": "25098482", "created_at": "2026-11-04T14:00:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117980340455383118"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 14, "id": "26579339", "start": 9, "username": "PIIE"}, {"end": 21, "id": "25390350", "start": 16, "username": "OECD"}, {"end": 43, "id": "27860681", "start": 28, "username": "WorldBankGroup"}, {"end": 163, "id": "1133114759602032640", "start": 147, "username": "gordon_h_hanson"}, {"end": 175, "id": "1305556297", "start": 165, "username": "AdamPosen"}, {"end": 189, "id": "279036722", "start": 177, "username": "jasonfurman"}, {"end": 244, "id": "1005485805131980801", "start": 231, "username": "stescarpetta"}], "urls": [{"description": "The conference will explore: (i) the expected impacts of AI on labor markets and structural transformation, and how these impacts are shaped by demographic trends and patterns of international specialization, (ii) how policies, especially structural policies, can smooth labor market transitions by supporting the creation of good jobs, (iii) how governments can prepare workers for a changing labor market, and (iv) what policy lessons can be drawn from specific country experiences.", "display_url": "imf.org/en/news/semina…", "end": 291, "expanded_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/news/seminars/conferences/2026/11/17/imf-oecd-piie-world-bank-conference", "images": [{"height": 405, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117980347816452096/vTlM3p20?format=png&name=orig", "width": 400}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117980347816452096/vTlM3p20?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 268, "status": 200, "title": "IMF-OECD-PIIE-World Bank Conference: Labor Markets and Structural Transformation in Times of Change: AI and Demographic Shifts", "unwound_url": "https://www.imf.org/en/news/seminars/conferences/2026/11/17/imf-oecd-piie-world-bank-conference", "url": "https://t.co/kpQrmUyzC4"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/xWt96KMsv0", "end": 315, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2117980340455383118/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117980189695320064", "start": 292, "url": "https://t.co/xWt96KMsv0"}]}, "id": "2117980340455383118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 11379, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 10}, "text": "Join us, @PIIE, @OECD &amp; @WorldBankGroup Nov 17–18 to explore AI, demographic shifts &amp; the future of work. Speakers include: IMF DMD Bo Li, @gordon_h_hanson, @AdamPosen, @JasonFurman, @nkerameu, Signe Krogstrup, Aart Kraay, @stescarpetta &amp; Ahmad Al-Yamani. https://t.co/kpQrmUyzC4 https://t.co/xWt96KMsv0", "url": "https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2117980340455383118"}, {"author_id": "321536046", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:42:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117975656734593346"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "bea.gov/data/intl-trad…", "end": 122, "expanded_url": "https://bea.gov/data/intl-trade-investment/international-trade-goods-and-services", "start": 99, "status": 200, "title": "International Trade in Goods and Services | U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA)", "unwound_url": "https://bea.gov/data/intl-trade-investment/international-trade-goods-and-services", "url": "https://t.co/iabpVcJ3yV"}, {"display_url": "gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fbea.gov%2Fdata%2Fintl-trade-investment%2Finternational-trade-goods-and-services&data=05%7C02%7CFrederick.Poole%40bea.gov%7Cc756a15dde164b1187c408df3a78d4c8%7Cb1c9802897414918bb2e23f328481250%7C0%7C0%7C639293962803917096%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=2Y7f30PvDac%2BYqwsn4CCWPyijLnc9xexTcbsTPIG1aw%3D&reserved=0", "start": 123, "status": 200, "title": "International Trade in Goods and Services | U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA)", "unwound_url": "https://bea.gov/data/intl-trade-investment/international-trade-goods-and-services", "url": "https://t.co/DTDZJxujaY"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/MKCNf2hvxt", "end": 170, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2117975656734593346/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117975646009774080", "start": 147, "url": "https://t.co/MKCNf2hvxt"}]}, "id": "2117975656734593346", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 799, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The United States’ trade deficit in goods and services decreased to $105.0 billion in September.\n \nhttps://t.co/iabpVcJ3yV https://t.co/DTDZJxujaY https://t.co/MKCNf2hvxt", "url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2117975656734593346"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:39:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117974961218580573"], "id": "2117974961218580573", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 31135, "like_count": 116, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 14, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Post-midterms, three political dynamics will influence the economic and market outlook:\n  How will Republicans come together between Election Day and the seating of the next Congress to pass what they consider priority legislation before relinquishing their majority?\n  Which", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117974961218580573"}, {"author_id": "321536046", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:30:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117972805455143052"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "bea.gov/data/intl-trad…", "end": 123, "expanded_url": "https://bea.gov/data/intl-trade-investment/international-trade-goods-and-services", "start": 100, "status": 200, "title": "International Trade in Goods and Services | U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA)", "unwound_url": "https://bea.gov/data/intl-trade-investment/international-trade-goods-and-services", "url": "https://t.co/iabpVcJ3yV"}]}, "id": "2117972805455143052", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 907, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The United States’ trade deficit in goods and services decreased to $105.0 billion in September. \n \nhttps://t.co/iabpVcJ3yV", "url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2117972805455143052"}, {"author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971891818533138"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MIXvfFG6vx", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117971891818533138/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117971598766718976", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/MIXvfFG6vx"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/MIXvfFG6vx", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117971891818533138/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117971637471707136", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/MIXvfFG6vx"}]}, "id": "2117971891818533138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 36195, "like_count": 155, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 46, "retweet_count": 26}, "text": "The initial market reaction to the Democrats’ stunning win in the midterm elections is defying standard playbook expectations:\nStocks are higher and government bond yields are lower (CNBC data below).\nWhat analysts would have likely predicted, however, is the performance within https://t.co/MIXvfFG6vx", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2117971891818533138"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:54:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117963622395634094"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/yexk30ESB8", "end": 284, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117963622395634094/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117963617454747648", "start": 261, "url": "https://t.co/yexk30ESB8"}]}, "id": "2117963622395634094", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 7940, "like_count": 35, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "Central bankers, market practitioners and academics are meeting in Frankfurt tomorrow for the annual ECB Conference on Money Markets, where they will discuss developments in money markets, innovations and the challenges that lie ahead.\n\nCheck out the programme https://t.co/yexk30ESB8", "url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117963622395634094"}, {"author_id": "83466368", "created_at": "2026-11-04T11:00:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117935131474149635"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 236, "id": "304909941", "start": 228, "username": "Lagarde"}], "urls": [{"description": "The European Central Bank (ECB) is the central bank of the European Union countries which have adopted the euro. Our main task is to maintain price stability in the euro area and so preserve the purchasing power of the single currency.", "display_url": "ecb.europa.eu/press/blog/dat…", "end": 277, "expanded_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/blog/date/2026/html/ecb.blog20261104~78299c3eaf.en.html", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117935142769422336/hTvYNYmY?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117935142769422336/hTvYNYmY?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 254, "status": 200, "title": "A warning from Europe's hot summer", "unwound_url": "https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/blog/date/2026/html/ecb.blog20261104~78299c3eaf.en.html", "url": "https://t.co/kJ0xWaJHk9"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/4kNiAXdgst", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/ecb/status/2117935131474149635/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117931260651749377", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/4kNiAXdgst"}]}, "id": "2117935131474149635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 33, "impression_count": 44123, "like_count": 223, "quote_count": 46, "reply_count": 235, "retweet_count": 49}, "text": "Extreme weather is becoming more frequent and more severe, and the associated costs are rising.\n\nEurope needs better protection against the financial fallout from climate change and a more flexible energy system, says President @Lagarde in her blog post https://t.co/k